  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">National Settlements Program Phase II</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa Nacional de Asentamientos Fase II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">COMPREHENSIVE INVESTMENT PROGRAM AIMED AT ADDRESSING THE SHELTER NEEDS OF THE COUNTRY&apos;S LOW INCOME HOUSEHOLDS, THROUGH FOUR COMPONENTS: (1) SQUATTER UPGRADING; (2) PROVISION OF NEW AFFORDABLE HOUSING SOLUTIONS; (3)PILOT CONVERSION OF PUBLIC RENTAL HOUSING ESTATES; AND (4) POLICY REFORM AND MINISTRY STRENGTHENING.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
